    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Network of Teaching & Learning carried out the first 2016 Seminar Series on March 2, 2016. The seminars series titled Flipping the Classroom: Using Mobile Devices to Engage Students in and Out of Class was attended by 41 faculty members and over 61 students across all entities in AKU in Pakistan, UK and East Africa.",
